"value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4506560","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4054790-1847286114038054","game_id":"steam-4054790","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes: v0.07.06","summary":"Demo Patch Notes: v0.07.06Localization in nine new languages, new Shield rules and bug fixes Hi everyone,Version 0.07.06 adds nine new languages to the demo, makes Shield work the same way in every situation, makes text easier to read on Steam Deck, and fixes several bugs that left cards stuck on screen.ChangesLocalizationThe demo is now available in Italian, Spanish, German, French, Brazilian Portuguese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese and Korean, alongside English. You can ch","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T21:42:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038054","verified_at":"2026-10-23T23:15:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4054790-1846651706690790","game_id":"steam-4054790","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes: v0.07.05","summary":"Demo Patch Notes: v0.07.05Minor changes and some bugfixes Hi everyone,Version 0.07.05 is a small update focused on the enemy and on how a run flows. The enemy makes better decisions, you’ll meet the same faces less often, and filling the board now has its own moment.ChangesEnemySacrifices: The enemy is smarter about when to sacrifice a card and when to play it.Clashes: The enemy reads Clashes more accurately and avoids placements you can punish straight away.Final move: We tuned how the enemy pl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:29:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690790","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4054790-1846018067930145","game_id":"steam-4054790","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes: v0.07.04","summary":"Demo Patch Notes: v0.07.04Minor changes and multiple bugfixes Hi everyone,Version 0.07.04 is a small update, including multiple bug fixes such as the enemy giving up in some battles and abnormally high GPU usage, and minor changes like adding full-length music for every Circle and improving how the enemy reads a Clash.Changes- Removed the \"Regions Left\" warning that appeared while you were losing a match, as it interrupted the battle flow and didn't tell you more than what you already see on the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T15:24:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930145","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4054790-1845383656396830","game_id":"steam-4054790","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.07.03: Major Changes to the Core Mechanics","summary":"Demo Update Notes: v0.07.03Reworked core rules, Canons, Relics and Arcana, three Circles of Hell, a new tutorial and full controller supportHi everyone,We've been quiet for the last few months because we've been cooking something major for Beatrix. We spent that time rebuilding the game's core rules and the systems around them, and version 0.07.03 is the result.The changes run so deep that almost everything is different from the previous demo. That's why we strongly encourage all players, old an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T15:28:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396830","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4054790-1833968530889481","game_id":"steam-4054790","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes: v0.03.02","summary":"Demo Patch Notes: v0.03.02Card Clash Rework, Mist Overhaul, Backpack System, Negative Vigor Gated & Tutorial ExpansionHi everyone,This is a big one. A lot of the changes in this build are gameplay-deep: we've reworked how Card Clashes resolve, restructured the Limbo Mist, gated negative Vigor behind specific conditions, and rebuilt the tutorial to teach it all properly. Some of these came directly from your feedback (the AI was too stupid, the border-dominance strategy was a little too reliable,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T21:14:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530889481","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4054790-1831432155577969","game_id":"steam-4054790","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes: v0.02.11","summary":"Demo Patch Notes: v0.02.11Mid-Run Save, Grimoire, Settings Overhaul, Tutorial Polish & Sound ImprovementsHi everyone,Big patch this time. We've been working on a few quality-of-life features that came up again and again in your feedback, and quite a bit of polish across the board. Let's get into it.What's NewMid-Run Save & Continue: You can now leave a run halfway through and pick up exactly where you left off. No more \"I have to finish this Circle before bedtime\" moments.Grimoire & Progress: A ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T16:29:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155577969","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4054790-1830163047254996","game_id":"steam-4054790","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes: v0.02.09","summary":"Patch Notes: v0.02.09Bug Fixes, Animation Speed Options, Enemy AI Improvements & Sound PolishHi everyone,These past couple of weeks we've been heads-down squashing bugs, tuning animations, and (most importantly) teaching Hell's denizens how to actually put up a fight. Let's get into it.What's NewAnimation Speed Options: You asked, we listened. You can now choose between Normal, Fast, and Very Fast battle animations. If you've been tapping your foot waiting for Canones or Card Clashes to resolve,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-15T14:05:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047254996","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4054790-1828441623107004","game_id":"steam-4054790","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes: v0.02.07","summary":"Patch Notes: v0.02.07 - Tutorial Fixes & Demo ContentHi everyone,The last few days have been a whirlwind. Seeing people actually playing the demo and breaking our systems has been both terrifying and amazing.We’ve been reading every bit of feedback, and one thing became clear immediately: our tutorial was failing you. Specifically, the \"drag to sacrifice\" part. We saw players getting stuck, thinking the game was broken when, in reality, we just hadn't explained the action well enough. We’ve adde","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-28T17:41:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623107004","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4054790-1827626365766461","game_id":"steam-4054790","kind":"announcement","title":"🖤 The Gates are Open: You can play the demo now!","summary":"Hi everyone, It’s a big day for us. After a long time spent in the trenches of development - tweaking Canones, balancing the \"Surround and Flip\" logic, and polishing the aesthetic of the afterlife - we’re finally ready. The demo is live. Honestly, it’s a bit nerve-wracking to finally hit \"publish,\" but we couldn’t be more excited to see how you all handle the first steps in Hell. What’s waiting for you in the Demo? We wanted this demo to feel like a real slice of the game, that's what you can ge","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-24T17:45:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365766461","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4054790":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:11Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:10Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4054790":"2026-10-26T11:23:11Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4054790":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:10Z"},"4506560":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:11Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4054790","app_id":4054790,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:27Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"34ec9fa37d0f910c0780e137275e45c9acef1eb2a6c963818066bc7deb81d125","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Beatrix는 단테의 지옥을 배경으로 한 다크 로그라이트 카드 배틀러입니다. 격자 위에 타로 카드를 놓고 적 카드를 포위해 내 편으로 뒤집으세요. 전투와 전투 사이에는 칸마다 효과를 배치해 필드를 직접 구축합니다. 이 효과는 카드가 그 칸에 놓일 때마다 발동합니다.","publishers":[{"n